,"caption":"Кюкю Ава (Умный)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:AwamokoGhostSprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/ad/AwamokoGhostSprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20220909015532","caption":"Авамоко Призрак (Умный)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:SulleyMokotchiSprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/dd/SulleyMokotchiSprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20230211045530","caption":"Салли Mokotchi (Умный)","sprite":true},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/69/6961c59139ce2e29f457.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamagotchiDotsSmartRubber.PNG","caption":"Tamagotchi Каучуковый ремешок в горошек"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/06/0644b9134e391f8c4ee8.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamagotchiDotsSmartKeychain.PNG","caption":"Tamagotchi Брелок в виде точек"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Awamokotchi_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/51/Awamokotchi_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20250103162303","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Авамокотчи","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Awamokotchi_MametchiMemories_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/4/42/Awamokotchi_MametchiMemories_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20261027161826","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Авамокотчи","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Goro2Awamoko.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/3/3e/Goro2Awamoko.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20220513174625","caption":"Из альбома «Авамокотчи» · № 27","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/3/3e/Goro2Awamoko.png/revision/latest?cb=20220513174625"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:AmemokofurashiArtwork.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/d0/AmemokofurashiArtwork.png/re